### Get analysis data
GET https://localhost:8443/api/list/5442/analysis
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### send an invitation to create a connection between two organizations
POST https://localhost:8443/api/list/5448/analysis
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "analysisIds": ["FCD"]
}

### send an invitation to create a connection between two organizations
POST https://localhost:8443/api/list/5442/analysis
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}
{
  "analysisIds": ["FCD"]
}
